{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 15013254256258470049,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Example programs for LiteOS",
      "source_hash": 15491985541050949527,
      "context_hash": 18386383412369885178,
      "translation": "LiteOS 예제 프로그램",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:28.538732Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This directory contains several examples to be used with LiteOS (install LiteOS first, instructions [here](https://github.com/BrunoLevy/learn-fpga/tree/master/LiteX/software/LiteOS)).",
      "source_hash": 8834344670835959516,
      "context_hash": 8288201448060596084,
      "translation": "이 디렉터리에는 LiteOS와 함께 사용할 수 있는 여러 예제가 포함되어 있습니다(먼저 LiteOS를 설치하십시오, 안내는 [여기](https://github.com/BrunoLevy/learn-fpga/tree/master/LiteX/software/LiteOS)에 있습니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:28.538732Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Compile the programs:",
      "source_hash": 9030619178483937355,
      "context_hash": 12966274724506067868,
      "translation": "프로그램을 컴파일합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:28.538732Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Then copy all `.elf` files to the SDCard.",
      "source_hash": 1004252980290706194,
      "context_hash": 11475014612532078436,
      "translation": "그런 다음 모든 `.elf` 파일을 SDCard에 복사하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:28.538732Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "Connect to the SoC (`litex_term /dev/ttyUSBnnn`), and verify that the programs are there:",
      "source_hash": 2785116264781497768,
      "context_hash": 4592555247986517060,
      "translation": "SoC에 연결하고(`litex_term /dev/ttyUSBnnn`), 프로그램이 있는지 확인하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:28.538732Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Now you can run the programs (for instance `hello.elf`):",
      "source_hash": 2294846458825937713,
      "context_hash": 9064296745650079661,
      "translation": "이제 프로그램을 실행할 수 있습니다(예를 들어 `hello.elf`):",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:28.538733Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "The following programs are available:",
      "source_hash": 6701166125148999753,
      "context_hash": 12580321440052937800,
      "translation": "다음 프로그램들을 사용할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:28.538733Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Program",
      "source_hash": 17938412249265480582,
      "context_hash": 6850508330980990907,
      "translation": "프로그램",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:28.538733Z",
      "issues": []
    },
