      "source_hash": 4707394487832384915,
      "context_hash": 2334825821569069428,
      "translation": "tinyraytracer",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:28.538733Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:18/seg:0",
      "source": "port of Dmitry Sokolov's tiny raytracer",
      "source_hash": 8810692192829645429,
      "context_hash": 10493787850481106470,
      "translation": "Dmitry Sokolov의 tiny raytracer 포팅 버전",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:28.538733Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:19/seg:0",
      "source": "imgui_test",
      "source_hash": 12004348187964492654,
      "context_hash": 9403615004306858645,
      "translation": "imgui_test",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:28.538733Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:20/seg:0",
      "source": "test program for Dear Imgui",
      "source_hash": 6328792476574341100,
      "context_hash": 14723006227243682337,
      "translation": "Dear Imgui용 테스트 프로그램",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:28.538733Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:21/seg:0",
      "source": "ST_NICCC needs `scene1.dat` to be copied on the SDCard.",
      "source_hash": 17384108278765407948,
      "context_hash": 16953225530424111273,
      "translation": "ST_NICCC는 `scene1.dat`가 SDCard에 복사되어 있어야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:28.538733Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Creating your own program",
      "source_hash": 5741217061340766218,
      "context_hash": 2430806389220947320,
      "translation": "자신만의 프로그램 만들기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:28.538733Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Just create `my_program.c` or `my_program.cpp` and add `my_program.elf` to the list in the `all:` target.",
      "source_hash": 683536093394136343,
      "context_hash": 2275472750679390965,
      "translation": "`my_program.c` 또는 `my_program.cpp`를 생성하고, `all:` 타겟 목록에 `my_program.elf`를 추가하기만 하면 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:28.538734Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "There are some libraries you can use [here](https://github.com/BrunoLevy/learn-fpga/tree/master/LiteX/software/Libs).",
      "source_hash": 16717478399507004667,
      "context_hash": 16546608507879174930,
      "translation": "사용할 수 있는 몇몇 라이브러리가 [여기](https://github.com/BrunoLevy/learn-fpga/tree/master/LiteX/software/Libs)에 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:28.538734Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "How it works",
      "source_hash": 16935900381963222246,
      "context_hash": 16372813950632340155,
      "translation": "작동 방식",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:28.538734Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "the linker script [linker.ld](linker.ld) and the memory map [regions.ld](regions.ld): The linker script is very simple, it is similar to LiteX linker script, with the difference that it sends everything to `main_ram` (the SDRAM).",
      "source_hash": 5637302974881967530,
      "context_hash": 1989513607418700967,
      "translation": "링커 스크립트 [linker.ld](linker.ld)와 메모리 맵 [regions.ld](regions.ld): 링커 스크립트는 매우 단순하며, LiteX 링커 스크립트와 유사하지만 모든 것을 `main_ram`(SDRAM)으로 보낸다는 점이 다릅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:28.538734Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The memory map declares `main_ram` 256KB after the actual address of the SDRAM, in order to leave it for FemtOS.",
      "source_hash": 16739259240676447431,
      "context_hash": 15672994786997163376,
      "translation": "메모리 맵은 `main_ram`을 SDRAM의 실제 주소보다 256KB 뒤에 선언하는데, 이는 FemtOS를 위한 공간을 남겨두기 위함입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:28.538734Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "the C runtime [crt0.S](crt0.S): it declares the global symbol `_start`, that does the following things:",
      "source_hash": 13505850461467200212,
      "context_hash": 4590631203721672608,
      "translation": "C 런타임 [crt0.S](crt0.S): 이는 전역 심볼 `_start`를 선언하며, 다음과 같은 작업을 수행합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:28.538734Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "save the context (all registers, except the snnn ones)",
      "source_hash": 14886694882010269485,
      "context_hash": 806831943107702270,
      "translation": "컨텍스트를 저장합니다(snnn 레지스터를 제외한 모든 레지스터)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:28.538734Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "initialize the `bss` segment to zero",
      "source_hash": 15007673030877422454,
      "context_hash": 11499423823594604115,
      "translation": "`bss` 세그먼트를 0으로 초기화합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:28.538734Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "call `main`",
      "source_hash": 12765715987209702152,
      "context_hash": 7303468616281785391,
      "translation": "`main`을 호출합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:28.538734Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "restore the context (saved registers)",
      "source_hash": 9195971919571112206,
      "context_hash": 10188714213487217920,
      "translation": "컨텍스트를 복원합니다(저장된 레지스터)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:28.538734Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "return to femtOS",
      "source_hash": 11019762657917158209,
      "context_hash": 11682156410645511943,
      "translation": "femtOS로 복귀합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:28.538734Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "the memory allocator [sbrk.c](sbrk.c): it implements the low-levem system call used under the hood by `malloc()`.",
      "source_hash": 11722177293292844081,
      "context_hash": 6298033657277184401,
      "translation": "메모리 할당자 [sbrk.c](sbrk.c)는 `malloc()`이 내부적으로 사용하는 저수준 시스템 호출을 구현합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:18.691027Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:8/seg:1",
      "source": "It is in fact quite simple, it just needs to keep track of the end of the heap.",
      "source_hash": 6207865459070673600,
      "context_hash": 9917642137063804545,
      "translation": "사실 매우 단순한데, 힙의 끝을 추적하기만 하면 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:18.691028Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}